{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_238_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，王二月，邾子益來奔。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"二、公會吳伐齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"三、三月，戊戌，齊侯陽生卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"四、夏，宋人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"五、晉趙鞅帥師侵齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"六、五月，公至自伐齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"七、葬齊悼公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"八、衞公孟彄自齊歸於衞。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"九、薛伯夷卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"十、秋，葬薛惠公。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"十一、冬，楚公子結帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_238_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_238","textTraditional":"十二、吳救陳。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}